"        <t t-out=\"object.requester_id.display_name or ''\">申請者</t>\n"
"        提出了新的簽核申請 <strong t-out=\"object.name or ''\">APR/2026/00001</strong>。\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        規則：<t t-out=\"object.rule_id.display_name or ''\">規則</t>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        業務單據：<t t-out=\"object.res_display_name or object.res_model\">model</t>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        當前關卡：<t t-if=\"object.current_step_id\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.current_step_id.display_name or ''\">關卡</t>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-else=\"\">無</t>\n"
"        <br/><br/>\n"
"        請至系統查看並進行簽核。\n"
"    </p>\n"
